# The updater compares SHA-1 hashes byte-for-byte against what it downloads.
# Git's automatic LF<->CRLF conversion would change text files (README, .bat,
# .lang) on checkout, so their served bytes would never match the manifest and
# the updater would re-download them on every single launch.
# Treat everything as binary so what we publish is exactly what we hashed.
* -text
